rong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has unique skills you can pick on level up and play very differently from each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commander: </strong>Field a big army, improve unit abilities and have better tactical deployment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior: </strong>Become so powerful you can kill hundreds of units by yourself, if you're good enough to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranger: </strong>Snipe enemies from afar, or use crossbows/primitive firearms to blast enemies up close</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hermit</strong>: Summon a bunch of powerful animals to wreck enemies or make your animals better\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayable without limits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No level caps on any units </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No maximum on most stats, so if you nurture some units they can become more powerful than you can imagine</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW : keep your favorite army and fight even crazier battles with the new endless mode feature, accessible once you beat the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352820/extras/17e12cba7f8fbaa049ab89370f9b67da.avif?t=1746320829\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
